# Lab 06 - ECS service auto scaling outputs
# Generated on 2026-10-13T19:30:43Z
# Contains names, IDs, ARNs and numbers only. NO SECRETS. Safe to commit.
# Sourced alongside lab-01/02/03/04/05. The CloudWatch lab reads the alarm and the
# custom metric; the CloudFormation lab re-declares every object named here.
# NOTE: USMS_SCHEDULED_OUT/IN name the actions this lab specifies; Floci 1.7 rejects
# put-scheduled-action (UnsupportedOperation), so they do not exist on this build.
# USMS_SCALABLE_RESOURCE_ID was derived with "${SVC_ARN##*:}" (Step 5's form): the lab's
# awk '{print \$NF}' keeps its backslash inside $( '...' ) in a heredoc, and awk rejects it.

